{"sectionId":"gene/replication","items":[{"id":"gene--replication-k001","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"DNA 복제는 반보존적이며 DNA polymerase는 주형을 3′→5′로 읽고 새 가닥을 5′→3′로 합성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k002","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"helicase가 이중나선을 풀고 단일가닥 결합 단백질이 안정화하며 topoisomerase가 비틀림을 완화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k003","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"primase는 primer를 제공하고 선도가닥은 연속적으로, 지연가닥은 오카자키 절편으로 합성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k004","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"ligase는 인산다이에스터 결합의 끊긴 부분을 연결한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k005","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"세균 DNA pol III는 주된 복제효소이고 pol I은 primer 제거·빈자리 채움에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k006","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"진핵세포에서 pol α-primase는 시작, pol ε와 δ는 주로 선도·지연가닥 합성에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k007","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"PCNA는 sliding clamp이며 RNase H와 FEN1 등이 primer 제거에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k008","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"텔로머레이스는 RNA 주형을 이용하는 역전사효소로 염색체 3′ 말단을 연장한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k009","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"복제 정확성은 염기 선택, proofreading 및 mismatch repair에 의해 높아진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k010","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"모든 DNA 합성은 5′→3′.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k011","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"선도와 지연은 복제분기점의 진행 방향과 관련된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k012","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"DNA ligase는 새 뉴클레오타이드를 중합하는 효소가 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k013","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"텔로머레이스 활성은 생식세포 및 일부 줄기세포·암세포에서 높을 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--replication-k014","sectionId":"gene/replication","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"그렇다. 여러 절편으로 불연속적으로 합성된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}